Author:     Risingtides-dev <smathdaddy@gmail.com>
AuthorDate: Thu Jul 16 09:57:56 2026 -0400
Commit:     Risingtides-dev <smathdaddy@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Thu Jul 16 10:23:11 2026 -0400

    TASK-11 transplant onto origin/main: room-scoped SSE tail, agent picker, codex review blockers

    Gate: 17/17 static contract + commit scope + builds + clippy + boot probe.

    - proxy: GET /v1/agents forward for same-origin PWA picker.
      Rooms SSE streams through sse_stream_response via an internal branch
      inside proxy_rooms_persistent (exact persistent/{key}/events shape match,
      not ends_with) rather than a separate axum route — avoids the
      {key}/events vs {*rest} route-table panic at startup.
      Last-Event-ID passthrough preserved.
    - rooms.rs: SSE tail replacing 2.5s poll, tail_state (Replaying/Live/
      Reconnecting) indicator with real EventSource state detection in the
      timeout arm, /v1/agents select-dropdown picker, timeout-aware stream
      loop (futures_util::select against 2s timeout), roster refresh on
      ParticipantJoined/ParticipantLeft frames guarded by generation+open_key,
      LiveKit call-site routing deleted (join_open/close_room/leave_open),
      dead livekit_room_id/livekit_token_path/show_livekit_controls fields
      removed from Rooms struct, livekit_token_path_for_room retained as
      pure utility for daemon.rs.
    - livekit.rs: dead disconnect_livekit_bridge deleted.
    - app.rs: Rooms::new() signature updated (3 LK args removed).
    - codex blockers resolved: reconnect state detection, roster refresh guard,
      agent picker select widget, available_agents set on empty/error,
      Clippy -D warnings green (both crates), exact persistent/{key}/events
      branch shape, task11-gate.sh not committed.

diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index e6acafc..78389fe 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -131,6 +131,21 @@ Web surface session UI:
   visible, but call/join affordances live behind overflow until intentionally
   opened or actively connected.

+## Rooms Contract
+
+- Room transcripts hydrate once, then tail only the room-scoped SSE endpoint
+  `GET /v1/rooms/persistent/{key}/events` with sequence resume. Do not restore
+  transcript polling or consume the global agent-event stream for Rooms.
+- The browser PWA proxy must forward `/v1/agents` as JSON and stream room SSE
+  unbuffered while preserving `Last-Event-ID`; Tauri reaches the same daemon
+  endpoints directly.
+- Agent participants are selected from daemon-owned `/v1/agents` identities
+  and remain subject to daemon join validation. Free-text agent creation does
+  not belong in the surface.
+- Rooms G1 is daemon-native text collaboration. LiveKit controls stay outside
+  the room join, leave, roster, and transcript lifecycle until explicitly
+  reintroduced behind a reviewed platform contract.
+
 ## Workspace Map

 | Path | Role |
